Package: biasProxyR
Title: BiasProxyR: Sampling Effort Proxies for SDMs
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Aamna", "Naveed", , "naamna588@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Addresses geographic sampling bias in Species Distribution 
    Models (SDMs) for data-poor regions. It generates sampling effort proxies 
    using open-source infrastructure data, allowing researchers to sample 
    bias-aware background points. This prevents models from learning 
    sampling artifacts instead of true ecological niches.
